Package: mctext
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: local-first desktop text vault
 Stores reusable text snippets in groups, copies the selected text to
 the system clipboard, and keeps a session-only clipboard log. The SBCL
 runtime, McText and DejaVuSans.ttf are bundled in the executable.
